      "url": "https://sdmiramar.edu/services/transfer/glossary",
      "summary": "San Diego Miramar College provides a comprehensive glossary of terms related to college transfer processes. It covers definitions and explanations of a range of academic terms, including degrees, financial aid options, educational certifications, and structure of college systems like CSU and UC. Key terms include Accreditation, Advanced Placement, Articulation Agreements, Associate Degrees, and IGETC. This glossary serves as a resource for students navigating the transfer from community college to universities.",
