      "summary": "The San Diego Miramar College Strategic Plan for 2020-2027 outlines the college's response to the evolving educational and socio-economic climate in San Diego and beyond. The plan focuses on five strategic themes: developing student-centered pathways, enhancing student engagement, improving organizational health, cultivating relationships, and advancing diversity, equity, and inclusion. By establishing clear goals and measurable outcomes, San Diego Miramar College aims to ensure the success and well-being of its diverse student body while fostering educational innovation and community partnerships.",
